===''I Choose You!''===
Route 1 appeared in the opening of ''[[M20|I Choose You!]]''. [[Ash Ketchum (M20)|Ash]] left [[Pallet Town]] via this route at the start of his journey, with his newly obtained, disobedient [[Ash's Pikachu (M20)|Pikachu]]. Ash and Pikachu were attacked by a large flock of {{p|Spearow}} and attempted to escape in the midst of a rainstorm, culminating in Pikachu unleashing a powerful {{m|Thunderbolt}} on the Spearow, knocking himself and his Trainer out in the process. Ash and Pikachu woke up after the storm had passed to see {{p|Ho-Oh}} flying overhead, dropping a [[Rainbow Feather|Rainbow Wing]] as it flew. Ash picked up the feather and proclaimed to Pikachu that they would meet it again someday.

